OL,3,GNEWSACommittee accuses council of
OL,4,A'silencing women'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's women and girls committee
OL,7,Fhas accused Reform-led council leaders
OL,8,Fof "silencing women" after a decision
OL,9,Fwas made for it to hold its meetings in
OL,10,Fprivate.
OL,12,FThis means the public can no longer
OL,13,Fattend the group's Gateshead Council
OL,14,Fmeetings.
OL,16,FCouncil leader Nick Allan said the
OL,17,Fdecision was recommended by council
OL,18,Fofficers, not by the ruling party,
OL,19,Fafter accusations some committee
OL,20,Fmembers and members of the public "got
OL,21,Fout of hand" at a meeting.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
