OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommittee accuses council of
OL,4,A'silencing women'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Dawn Welsh, Lib Dem, said:
OL,7,F"We have to ask ourselves why Reform
OL,8,Fwants to conduct this vital public
OL,9,Fbusiness behind closed doors - what do
OL,10,Fthey think residents shouldn't be
OL,11,Fallowed to see?" The council has been
OL,12,Fapproached for comment.
